Port modifications by Raymond (yippieyaray), 2026-09-28 through 2026-09-30.

Changes include the Java 25/Paper 26.2 build, neutral Java package namespace,
Bukkit permission checks for LuckPerms, inventory/crafting/hazard handling,
startup validation, configuration migration, localization, OP bypass and tests.
On 2026-09-30, comments, plugin metadata and documentation were updated,
and release notes were added to the versioned source distribution.
This is an independent fork, not an official release by the original maintainers.

