Distribution:
The binary ZIP includes the complete project source, resources, tests and Maven
build/assembly files in source/. Build with JDK 25 and Maven as described in
README.md. Maven resolves the dependencies declared in pom.xml.
Paper API is provided by the server; JUnit and Mockito are test dependencies.
These dependencies are not bundled in the plugin JAR and retain their own licenses.
When distributing the standalone JAR, also provide the corresponding source
from the same release (the binary ZIP includes it). Keep release tags aligned
with the exact source used to build the published JAR.

